{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 1, "model_name": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "content": "Fair traveler thou seekest a journey to Japan's land\nOf rising sun and mystic ways\nHere's an itinerary for thee to follow and abide\n\nDay the First\nThy arrival in Tokyo's bustling streets\nFrom airport thou shalt take a train to city's heart\nAt Hotel thy weary head shall rest and be at ease\nIn morning thou shalt visit famous Tsukiji Fish Market\nWhere freshest sushi and seafood on display\nThy taste buds shall dance with joy and delight\nNext thou shalt stroll through Asakusa's ancient streets\nAnd visit Sensoji Temple with its giant paper lanterns\n\nDay the Second\nThou shalt rise with sun and visit Meiji Shrine\nA tranquil oasis in midst of city's din and strife\nNext thou shalt stroll through beautiful Imperial Palace East Garden\nWhere tranquil waters and majestic trees entwine\nThen thou shalt visit famous Shibuya Crossing\nWhere young and old congregate in endless throng\nAnd at night thou shalt dine in trendy Harajuku\nWhere fashion and food in endless variety abound\n\nDay the Third\nThou shalt take train to Nikko's sacred mountains\nWhere Toshogu Shrine with its golden gates doth shine\nThy eyes shall feast on beauty and majesty\nAnd thy soul shall be lifted in awe and reverence\nNext thou shalt visit Rinnoji Temple with its peaceful gardens\nWhere nature's beauty and tranquility entwine\nThen thou shalt stroll through historic town of Kamakura\nWhere ancient temples and shrines in silence stand\n\nDay the Fourth\nThou shalt visit Kiyomizu-dera Temple in Kyoto\nWhere wooden stage with its stunning views doth seem\nTo defy gravity and hang suspended in air\nAnd thy heart shall be filled with wonder and delight\nNext thou shalt stroll through beautiful Arashiyama Bamboo Grove\nWhere gentle rustle of bamboo in wind doth seem\nTo whisper secrets of ancient wisdom and mystic lore\nThen thou shalt visit Fushimi Inari Shrine with its thousands of vermillion gates\nWhere endless corridors of orange in majesty entwine\n\nDay the Fifth\nThou shalt visit Nara's ancient city with its gentle charm\nWhere Todaiji Temple with its giant Buddha doth stand\nThy eyes shall feast on beauty and majesty\nAnd thy soul shall be lifted in awe and reverence\nNext thou shalt stroll through Nara Park with its friendly deer\nWho shall approach thee with gentle eyes and soft steps\nThen thou shalt visit Kasuga-taisha Shrine with its thousands of stone and bronze lanterns\nWhere ancient traditions and mystic lore doth seem to shine.\n\nThus endeth thy journey to Japan's enchanted land\nMay thy heart be filled with wonder and delight\nAnd may thy spirit be lifted in awe and reverence\nFor thou hast beheld the beauty and majesty of this fair land.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Fair", "logprob": -0.08163616}, {"token": " traveler", "logprob": -0.079575405}, {"token": " thou", "logprob": -0.17345776}, {"token": " see", "logprob": -0.1606858}, {"token": "kest", "logprob": -9.97732e-05}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.85221833}, {"token": " journey", "logprob": -0.5111953}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.19632839}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -0.062069237}, {"token": "'s", "logprob": -0.10045276}, {"token": " land", "logprob": -1.2998961}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.14836438}, {"token": "Of", "logprob": -1.5357553}, {"token": " rising", "logprob": -0.38279378}, {"token": " sun", "logprob": -0.00027605062}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.44279835}, {"token": " myst", "logprob": -0.8759619}, {"token": "ic", "logprob": -0.0010845738}, {"token": " ways", "logprob": -2.0397074}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -1.3029319}, {"token": "Here", "logprob": -1.0173757}, {"token": "'s", "logprob": -1.0921574}, {"token": " an", "logprob": -0.30219388}, {"token": " itinerary", "logprob": -0.00520719}, {"token": " for", "logprob": -0.47179577}, {"token": " thee", "logprob": -0.3931963}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.11160239}, {"token": " follow", "l